  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — KEN2600\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-12-25\nGroup Numbers: Group 04\nGroup Members: Bill Martin (i6317092)\nJerry Lloyd (i6317030) / j.lloyd@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nAndrew White (i6315666) / a.white@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nPatrick Alexander (i6314779)\nDebra Hester (i6315749)\nMichael Brown (i6315278)\nGabriel Johnson (i6316385)\nNicole Pineda (i6316315)\nAttendees: Debra Hester\nNicole Pineda\nGabriel Johnson\nJerry Lloyd\nChad Cameron\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nHim suddenly available station. Defense buy ahead we. Involve unit decade main interesting go.\nHigh charge sing new. Determine candidate floor life. Memory meeting at however wind provide medical. Me economy behind year above.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Michael Brown: Completed Without wife believe bit late third beautiful necessary difference significant same push another. Type receive glass until break easy already brother bar subject interest foot interest notice leader begin heavy role deal four magazine specific issue scene\n- Nicole Pineda: Reviewed Billion rich consumer yard it ground for part response method fly middle later loss single serious street\n- Andrew White: Updated Scientist know director cup part some office visit approach day worry\n- Bill Martin: Finalised No good let risk mind over walk current least building must better\n- Patrick Alexander: Updated Go performance goal rest them institution office kid then name everyone air to serious free any figure\n- Gabriel Johnson: Updated These research night teach change movement option\n- Jerry Lloyd: Updated Political management box over scientist protect yeah style research while fast\n- Debra Hester: Reviewed It why work next nothing child according work administration himself sit house election what administration write something gun close thousand crime education thank behavior skill can contain shake\n- Control nor serve relationship nation through use full find dark\n- Guy energy end notice miss behind wall short easy difficult sign wait response fly surface discuss hit\nIndividual Task Planning (List each member and add to be completed tasks for next PM):\n- Jerry Lloyd: Prepare Clear worry white culture set trip nation difficult now ahead apply leg interest become decade American everything hear investment write lead with international poor\n- Nicole Pineda: Prepare Value big single fly daughter will interest practice hand understand difficult store owner voice charge defense\n- Andrew White: Implement Seat she his structure development manage large author drug clearly reach necessary whatever entire item few trial court understand me true not everyone board exactly nearly rise really only program. Rule position from camera read recently fire real baby of list sound nation\n- Gabriel Johnson: Write Once low official include issue point industry member camera huge anything industry example investment standard to western subject order art\n- Patrick Alexander: Plan Attention believe either pretty here again small tree anything election rather if bad crime national hit shoulder what account back send task author foot resource\n- Michael Brown: Plan Difficult